# Kernel-tree style. SortIncludes off: include order is load-bearing (the kernel README's "Order-dependent placement").
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
NamespaceIndentation: None
SortIncludes: false
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AlignEscapedNewlines: Left
Standard: Latest
